name: Link Analysis telecom revenue assurance showcase
tagline: "A seeded telecom revenue-assurance Link Analysis demo - unbilled usage, dealer commission fraud and PBX hacking, planted among 7 500 subscribers, 200 dealers and 150 enterprise trunks with benign look-alikes"
description: "The mobile-operator revenue-assurance Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier. Seven synthetic feeds (dealer, subscriber, network_usage, billing_record, topup, enterprise_trunk, trunk_call; 12 months landed from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged; 7 500 subscribers activated by 200 dealers, about 67 000 subscriber-months of usage and of billing, 30 000 top-ups, 150 enterprise trunks of 120 customers and 14 000 trunk-days of international calls) are landed by seven Collectors and Pipelines. The telco_ra_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of five link kinds; the telco_ra_screen_links Job derives the three revenue-assurance screens the saved views read. Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-telco-ra-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by TelcoRaLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-telco-ra-data.test.mjs): 300 SIMs activated by one dealer on one device on one day, used every month and never billed; a dealer whose 400 SIMs on its 3 devices are each topped up once at its own shop to earn the commission and then go dormant; four enterprise trunks hacked to call premium-rate numbers in three countries at night and at weekends. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: the network test team's SIMs on the known list, a dealer near a university whose start-of-term SIMs stay active, and a firm calling its Singapore office in that office's working hours. SIM box, Wangiri and IRSF are in la-showcase. Three saved views. Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:signal
contents[5]: "7 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months landed, 1 month staged)", "telco_ra_links Job + Dataset (5 link kinds, via) and the telco_ra_screen_links Dataset of three revenue-assurance screens", "3 saved views (unbilled usage, commission spikes, PBX off-hours calls)", "3 planted stories with benign look-alikes", "Ground truth and golden tests in the repository"
